    "Titles": {
        "eng": "Wonderful Precure!",
        "jpn": "わんだふるぷりきゅあ！"
    },
    "Summaries": {
        "eng": "Animal Town is a town where animals and people live together. Iroha loves animals and is good friends with her dog, Komugi! One day, a mysterious monster, Garugaru wreaks havoc in the town! In order to protect Iroha, Komugi became a human and transformed into a Precure!? I have to save the child whose heart is being gargall'ed...! Let's join forces and return the animals to the Nico Garden!",
        "jpn": "プリキュアシリーズ第21作目。"
    },
    "Aliases": [
        "Wandafuru Purikyua!",
        "Wonderful Pretty Cure!"
    ],
    "Modified": "2025-10-01",
